flowchart TB
    User([User]) -->|owns 0..many| Workspace[Workspace<br/><i>backend domain: Project</i>]
    Workspace -->|contains 0..many| Document[Document]
    Workspace -->|contains 0..many| Conversation[Conversation]

    subgraph DocumentArtifacts[Reusable Document Representation]
        direction TB
        Sections[Text Sections]
        Chunks[Chunks]
        Understanding[Understanding / Metadata]
        Technical[Technical Analysis]
        OCR[OCR Analysis]
    end

    Document --> Sections
    Document --> Chunks
    Document --> Understanding
    Document --> Technical
    Document --> OCR

    Conversation -->|contains ordered| Messages[Messages]
    Messages -->|assistant messages snapshot| Sources[Message Sources]

    Reuse[Documents belong to the Workspace<br/>and can support multiple Conversations] -. shared scope .-> Workspace

    classDef primary fill:#e5e7eb,stroke:#374151,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#111111;
    classDef artifact fill:#ffffff,stroke:#4b5563,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111111;
    classDef note fill:#fafafa,stroke:#6b7280,stroke-dasharray:5 3,color:#111111;
    class Workspace,Document,Conversation,Messages,Sources primary;
    class Sections,Chunks,Understanding,Technical,OCR artifact;
    class Reuse note;
